 },
 "synthesis": null,
 "_why": [
  "vCLONE is a voice in the DeltaVerse registry that renders nothing, and its",
  "registry note says so in three words: 'voice not cloned'. This file is the",
  "same statement in the same format as the voices that DO exist, so the cast",
  "has a shape for it rather than a hole.",
  "",
  "measured and vprint are null because nothing has been measured. They are",
  "filled by `voaice.py measure` against a real capture \u2014 web/capture.html",
  "makes one from a microphone. Until then a null here is the truth and a",
  "plausible-looking number would not be.",
  "",
  "synthesis is the seam. A cloner would satisfy it: given the identity above,",
  "produce speech. Nothing in this repository implements one. The field exists",
  "so that the interface is written down and so that a file claiming a voice can",
  "be asked which model speaks it."
 ]
}
